| Design Tokens | Colors, typography, spacing, borders |
| Responsive Strategy | Breakpoints, mobile-first approach |
| Component Specs | Variants, sizes, states for each component |
| Page Layouts | Mobile, tablet, desktop layouts (ASCII diagrams) |
| Touch Targets | Minimum sizes, spacing requirements |

