Delegate to `dev-ui-designer` after App Design is complete:

```
@dev-ui-designer Create visual design specifications for [project name].
CONTEXT: Reference .claude/design/app-design.md for pages and components.
OUTPUT: Create .claude/design/ui-design.md with design tokens and responsive specs.
```

