### When to Skip UI Design

You can skip UI Design for:
- Simple CRUD apps with minimal UI
- Admin dashboards using existing component libraries
- Prototypes where visual polish isn't needed yet

Always use UI Design for:
- User-facing applications
- Projects requiring mobile support
- Applications needing dark mode
- Projects with brand requirements

